# What is NOT uploaded to the Sauce Labs VM, for the CANVAS harness.
#
# A WHITELIST, NOT A BLACKLIST, AND THE REASON IS SECRETS.
# A blacklist leaks whatever nobody thought to name. Everything is excluded on
# the first line and the paths this suite actually needs are added back, so a
# new directory arriving in this package is excluded by default rather than
# uploaded by default. The cost of getting a whitelist wrong is a missing file
# and a loud failure; the cost of getting a blacklist wrong is a credential on
# someone else's infrastructure.
#
# THIS LIST IS LONGER THAN THE ROOT ONE ON PURPOSE. That suite serves a static
# HTML report. This one BUILDS AND RUNS the product in the VM -- a Vite dev
# server and the planner -- so it genuinely needs the application source, the
# server, the build configuration and the specs.

# 1. Everything.
*

# 2. What the canvas harness genuinely needs in the VM.
#    A directory has to be un-ignored before anything inside it can be.
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!index.html
!.nvmrc

!playwright.config.ts
!playwright.sauce.config.ts

# Build and type configuration. `npm run server:build` and `npm run dev` both
# read these, and `npm run server:build` type-checks.
!vite.config.ts
!vite.server.config.ts
!vite-plugin-engine.ts
!vite-plugin-search.ts
!tsconfig.json
!tsconfig.canvas.json
!tsconfig.server.json

# The specs and their helpers.
!e2e/
!e2e/**

# The application, the planner, and the scripts the build calls.
!src/
!src/**
!server/
!server/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**

# The planner's on-disk ledger. It is written during a run; shipping the
# committed file keeps a cloud run starting from the same state as a local one.
!data/
!data/**

# 3. Re-excluded even though rule 1 already covers them.
#    Belt and braces: if a future edit loosens rule 1, or a matcher treats a
#    pattern differently than expected, these must still never be uploaded.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
.sauce/credentials.yml
**/credentials.yml
**/node_modules/
dist/
dist-server/
test-results/
playwright-report/
playwright-report-sauce/
